        "GrannyRedAge": "Calculate Granny Red's age based on Sally Thirtytwo's and Sally Four's ages",
        "SallyTwoAge": "Find out Sally Two's age given Granny Red's and Sally Four's ages",
        "TotalAgeCalculation": "Sum up the ages of all four birds"
