- "SallyFourAge" is directly dependent on "SallyThirtytwoAge".
- "GrannyRedAge" depends on both "SallyThirtytwoAge" and "SallyFourAge".
- "SallyTwoAge" depends on "GrannyRedAge" and "SallyFourAge".
- "TotalAgeCalculation" depends on all the individual ages.

This ensures that each task is logically consistent with the problem statement, avoiding redundancy.
